{
  "$comment": [
    "Where each AI agent client keeps its MCP server configuration. Read by src/discovery/clients.ts; this file is the only place a path lives.",
    "verified: upstream = taken from snyk/agent-scan at the commit named in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.attribution.md, not re-checked against an install. verified: docs = written from the client's own documentation, with a hand-written fixture under fixtures/clients/. No entry says install: none was read from a real installation.",
    "Path grammar: ~/ (home), %APPDATA%/ and %USERPROFILE%/ (from the environment passed in), ./ (the directory the scan runs in). A final segment may be *.ext; **/name matches name at any depth.",
    "status: not covered means the client is listed in the output as not covered, never silently left out."
  ],
  "upstream": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/snyk/agent-scan",
    "commit": "2527530b842e681404a8daad06c65f1973fc90c8",
    "file": "src/agent_scan/well_known_clients.py",
    "license": "Apache-2.0"
  },
